{"meta":{"format_version":"4.10","model_format":"free","box_uv":false},"name":"goblin_wolf_pen","model_identifier":"goblin_wolf_pen","visible_box":[1,1,0],"variable_placeholders":"","variable_placeholder_buttons":[],"timeline_setups":[],"unhandled_root_fields":{"description":"# goblin_wolf_pen\n\nGoblin wolf pen: a ring of lashed, leaning stakes with a crude stick gate, gnawed bones and a water trough of a split log.\n\n- Footprint: 8 x 8 columns (128 x 128 units, 3.60 x 3.60 m), centred on the origin, front (door side) faces -Z.\n- Finished bounds: x -66..67, y -0..55, z -65..65 units.\n- Texture: 256 x 256, 1 px per unit, square pixels, nearest filtering. Every visible face has its own texture region painted with its material at world position (seams line up across faces); identical faces share a region; construction and ruined pieces map into the region of the face they were cut from. No cube is cut to fit the texture.\n- Cubes: finished 168, construction_0 114, construction_33 114, construction_66 112, ruined 118 (601 rotated: roof slabs and a few leaning props).\n\n## Hit box\n\n- stake ring: 120 x 50 x 120, 3 u thick, gate 24 u wide in the north side\n\n## State group sets (children of `root`; show exactly one)\n\n- `finished`: the finished building (visible by default).\n- `construction_0`, `construction_33`, `construction_66`: build progress at 0 %, 33 % and 66 % (staked outline and scaffold, then walls rising inside scaffold, then full frame with roof rafters).\n- `ruined`: collapsed shell, broken walls, rubble, fallen roof (use with `_damaged.png`, or `_abandoned.png` for F7 abandoned buildings).\n- `goblin_wolf_pen_damaged.png`: damaged texture (scorch, holes, cracks) for the same UVs; works on every group set.\n- `goblin_wolf_pen_abandoned.png`: abandoned look (damage plus moss, faded cloth, cold fires) = `abandoned_goblin_wolf_pen` together with the `ruined` set or the finished set.\n\n## Attachment and effect points (empty groups)\n\n- `slot_door` at (0, 0, -70)\n- `slot_pen` at (0, 0, 0)\n"},"resolution":{"width":256,"height":256},"elements":[{"name":"stk0_0","box_uv":false,"rescale":false,"locked":false,"light_emission":0,"render_order":"default","allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[-60.0,0.0,-61.5],"to":[-55.7446,43.7992,-58.5],"autouv":0,"color":0,"inflate":0.0,"origin":[-57.8723,0,-60],"faces":{"north":{"uv":[199.0,51.2008,203.2554,95.0],"texture":0},"east":{"uv":[234.5,51.2008,237.5,95.0],"texture":0},"south":{"uv":[199.0,51.2008,203.2554,95.0],"texture":0},"west":{"uv":[234.5,51.2008,237.5,95.0],"texture":0},"up":{"uv":[206.0,190.5,210.2554,193.5],"texture":0},"down":{"uv":[206.0,190.5,210.2554,193.5],"texture":0}},"type":"cube","uuid":"045c4572-6880-5f52-b990-03ab2c51fc3d","rotation":[0.3456,0,-0.4989]},{"name":"stk0_0_tip","box_uv":false,"rescale":false,"locked":false,"light_emission":0,"render_order":"default","allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[-59.2,43.7992,-60.8],"to":[-56.5446,47.7992,-59.2],"autouv":0,"color":0,"inflate":0.0,"origin":[-57.8723,0,-60],"faces":{"north":{"uv":[134.8,182.2008,137.4554,186.2008],"texture":0},"east":{"uv":[24.2,190.2008,25.8,194.2008],"texture":0},"south":{"uv":[134.8,182.2008,137.4554,186.2008],"texture":0},"west":{"uv":[24.2,190.2008,25.8,194.2008],"texture":0},"up":{"uv":[9.8,203.2,12.4554,204.8],"texture":0},"down":{"uv":[9.8,203.2,12.4554,204.8],"texture":0}},"type":"cube","uuid":"d554cc1d-7a86-5c22-960c-1e8a808e0189","rotation":[0.3456,0,0]},{"name":"stk0_1","box_uv":false,"rescale":false,"locked":false,"light_emission":0,"render_order":"default","allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[-55.2446,0.0,-61.5],"to":[-51.2996,37.6193,-58.5],"autouv":0,"color":0,"inflate":0.0,"origin":[-53.2721,0,-60],"faces":{"north":{"uv":[36.7554,142.3807,40.7004,180.0],"texture":0},"east":{"uv":[86.5,142.3807,89.5,180.0],"texture":0},"south":{"uv":[36.7554,142.3807,40.7004,180.0],"texture":0},"west":{"uv":[86.5,142.3807,89.5,180.0],"texture":0},"up":{"uv":[211.7554,190.5,215.7004,193.5]